# Linking Humanities Research and Teaching.

**Authors:** Stearns, Peter

## Abstract
Developments in humanities scholarship are moving in surprisingly congruent directions. Far from competing with proper attention to pedagogy, they provide solid bases for curricular coherence and teaching effectiveness. New integrative themes crossing disciplinary lines in humanities, focusing here on history, can help fulfill several humanities goals in a novel framework. (MSE)

